  ⚠ **the null's MEDIAN is 0.230** — that is how much R² gain a series with no break whatsoever hands you for free. Any Δmax read without this number is a narrative.

=== (2b) THE LINEAR MODEL'S OWN NULL — one null cannot serve two statistics ===
  linear null Δmax: median **0.533** · 95th **0.690**  (the mean model's was 0.386)
  observed linear/index Δmax 0.552 ⇒ above ITS null: **False**
  ⚠ a piecewise line fits 4 parameters to the mean model's 2, so its free gain is larger by construction. Judging it against the mean model's null would manufacture detections.

